{:edb/db-before-t 1364 :edb/db-after-t 1365 :edb/tx-data [[13194139534677 50 #inst "2026-10-08T03:58:05.033Z" 13194139534677 true] [17592186100802 1020 #edb/ref 17592186302839 13194139534677 true] [17592186100802 1020 #edb/ref 17592186302846 13194139534677 true] [17592186100802 1020 #edb/ref 17592186302860 13194139534677 true] [17592186100802 1020 #edb/ref 17592186302875 13194139534677 true] [17592186100803 1020 #edb/ref 17592186302832 13194139534677 true] [17592186100803 1020 #edb/ref 17592186302853 13194139534677 true] [17592186100803 1020 #edb/ref 17592186302867 13194139534677 true] [17592186285381 1000 #edb/ref 17592186302874 13194139534677 true] [17592186302832 1017 #edb/ref 17592186302833 13194139534677 true] [17592186302832 1089 "q-102687" 13194139534677 true] [17592186302832 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139534677 true] [17592186302832 1100 "Find the Cartesian equation of the curve defined parametrically as\n\n$$\nx=\\operatorname{cos}⁡t,\\,\\,\\,y=\\operatorname{tan}⁡t,\\,0<t<\\frac{\\pi }{2}.\n$$" 13194139534677 true] [17592186302832 1113 #uuid "b89cfc2a-8e7d-5178-aba5-ef09172b413a" 13194139534677 true] [17592186302832 1145 "First, let's make the trigonometric functions the subject of each equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=\\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\, & ⇒\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡t=x \\\\ y=\\operatorname{tan}⁡t\\, & ⇒\\,\\operatorname{tan}⁡t=y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the Pythagorean identity ${sin}^{2}⁡t+{cos}^{2}⁡t=1$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{sin}^{2}⁡t+{cos}^{2}⁡t & =1 \\\\ {sin}^{2}⁡t & =1-{cos}^{2}⁡t \\\\ \\operatorname{sin}⁡t & =\\sqrt{1-{cos}^{2}⁡t}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe used here that $\\operatorname{sin}⁡t>0$ in the range $0<t<\\frac{\\pi }{2}.$\n\nNow, using the definition of a tangent, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{tan}⁡t=\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡t}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡t}=\\frac{\\sqrt{1-{cos}^{2}⁡t}}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡t}.\n$$\n\nSubstituting $\\operatorname{cos}⁡t=x$ and $\\operatorname{tan}⁡t=y$ into this formula, we get\n\n$$\ny=\\frac{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}{x}.\n$$\n\nSo the Cartesian equation of the given curve is $y=\\frac{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}{x}.$" 13194139534677 true] [17592186302833 1000 #edb/ref 17592186302834 13194139534677 true] [17592186302833 1000 #edb/ref 17592186302835 13194139534677 true] [17592186302833 1000 #edb/ref 17592186302836 13194139534677 true] [17592186302833 1000 #edb/ref 17592186302837 13194139534677 true] [17592186302833 1000 #edb/ref 17592186302838 13194139534677 true] [17592186302833 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534677 true] [17592186302833 1041 "selection" 13194139534677 true] [17592186302833 1104 #edb/ref 17592186302837 13194139534677 true] [17592186302833 1110 #uuid "b903b087-ccd3-56b3-8084-f93deb93fe48" 13194139534677 true] [17592186302834 1034 "y=\\frac{1-{x}^{2}}{x}" 13194139534677 true] [17592186302834 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534677 true] [17592186302834 1111 #uuid "cf1509d9-45c6-55be-96b2-ecd94d43aab8" 13194139534677 true] [17592186302835 1034 "y=\\frac{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}{2x}" 13194139534677 true] [17592186302835 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534677 true] [17592186302835 1111 #uuid "9c9bdda6-72e2-56ab-ad61-6fb1c887a147" 13194139534677 true] [17592186302836 1034 "y=\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}" 13194139534677 true] [17592186302836 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534677 true] [17592186302836 1111 #uuid "19f54f1d-e824-51ed-a708-863820445e0c" 13194139534677 true] [17592186302837 1034 "y=\\frac{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}{x}" 13194139534677 true] [17592186302837 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534677 true] [17592186302837 1111 #uuid "7d6b90c3-39cf-5897-ac2d-cb9f6b6d52b6" 13194139534677 true] [17592186302838 1034 "y=\\frac{1-{x}^{2}}{2x}" 13194139534677 true] [17592186302838 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534677 true] [17592186302838 1111 #uuid "cb9f7b51-1cf0-51e9-8432-b994b253edbf" 13194139534677 true] [17592186302839 1017 #edb/ref 17592186302840 13194139534677 true] [17592186302839 1089 "q-15653" 13194139534677 true] [17592186302839 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139534677 true] [17592186302839 1100 "Find the Cartesian equation of the curve defined parametrically by\n\n$$\nx=5-t,\\,\\,\\,y={t}^{2}-1,\\,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).\n$$" 13194139534677 true] [17592186302839 1113 #uuid "f4b8d660-3a86-5682-af7d-01dd831d3e28" 13194139534677 true] [17592186302839 1145 "To find the Cartesian equation, we eliminate $t.$ First, we use the $x$ equation to solve for $t:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=5-t\\,⇒\\,t=5-x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, substituting $t=5-x$ into our expression for $y,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & =(5-x)^{2}-1 \\\\  & =25-10x+{x}^{2}-1 \\\\  & ={x}^{2}-10x+24\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo the Cartesian equation of the given curve is $y={x}^{2}-10x+24.$\n\nFinally, since $t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )$ and $x=5-t,$ we must have $x\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).$\n\nSo, the complete Cartesian equation is\n\n$$\ny={x}^{2}-10x+24,\\,x\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).\n$$" 13194139534677 true] [17592186302840 1000 #edb/ref 17592186302841 13194139534677 true] [17592186302840 1000 #edb/ref 17592186302842 13194139534677 true] [17592186302840 1000 #edb/ref 17592186302843 13194139534677 true] [17592186302840 1000 #edb/ref 17592186302844 13194139534677 true] [17592186302840 1000 #edb/ref 17592186302845 13194139534677 true] [17592186302840 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534677 true] [17592186302840 1041 "selection" 13194139534677 true] [17592186302840 1104 #edb/ref 17592186302844 13194139534677 true] [17592186302840 1110 #uuid "a36a3d15-0cf4-5e08-87fa-99ae2e72c7af" 13194139534677 true] [17592186302841 1034 "y=-4{x}^{2}-2x+5,\\,x\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" 13194139534677 true] [17592186302841 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534677 true] [17592186302841 1111 #uuid "0fd83642-b933-54a1-bfde-60a80cc4043a" 13194139534677 true] [17592186302842 1034 "y=5{x}^{2}+x+2,\\,x\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" 13194139534677 true] [17592186302842 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534677 true] [17592186302842 1111 #uuid "3bdc3e